// Operation ECHOLEAK - Additional File Access Investigation
// Purpose: Identify file-access activity after the initial suspicious
// Copilot interactions to investigate possible continued activity.
// Data source: OfficeActivity_CL (training environment)
// Investigation start: September 20, 2026, 10:44 UTC
// Note: RunId, table names, and user identifiers are specific to this lab.
// Reviewing any additional file activity after 10:44 UTC.
// I'll compare these results with the Copilot logs to see if the activity is related.

OfficeActivity_CL
| where RunId == "el--17-20260920"
| where UserId == "emily.chen@cormorantcapital.com"
| where Operation == "FileAccessed"
| where TimeGenerated > datetime(2026-09-20 10:44:00)
| project TimeGenerated, OfficeWorkload, OfficeObjectId
| order by TimeGenerated asc
